    and the owner is on the blacklist.

% reverts: Pausable: paused
it must not be true that
    an owner approves a spender for an amount
    and the token is paused.

when an owner approves a spender for an amount
then the allowance of the owner for the spender that is a second amount becomes the amount.

% transferFrom
% reverts: Panic 0x11 (arithmetic overflow or underflow)
it must not be true that
