then the balance of the recipient that is a second amount becomes second amount + amount.

when a spender moves an amount from an owner to a recipient
then the allowance of the owner for the spender that is a second amount becomes second amount - amount.

% transfer
% reverts: Panic 0x11 (arithmetic overflow or underflow)
it must not be true that
    a sender transfers an amount to a recipient
    and the balance of the recipient is a second amount
    and second amount + amount > the largest amount.

% reverts: ERC20: transfer amount exceeds balance
